# title: Shoot the player
# about: The other half of Attack, for a model with a fire clip and no swing: closes to five
# about: units at a walk, then stands and fires at the player, the call the retail scripts
# about: make (shootemup with attack kind 8, the record's first weapon, which the spawner
# about: fills with the source's own or the blaster bolt, aimed at the player), and walks again
# about: when they draw off past six. The fire op turns the body to the player itself and fires
# about: only when the aim is within the record's field of view, so a shooter the player
# about: circles behind turns first and fires next tick; the reload is the record's fire
# about: interval, which the spawner raises to the weapon's floor. Clip 1 stands in for the
# about: walk, 13 for the fire clip, 30 for the death. Dies with its own death clip and fades
# about: eight seconds later.
script "shot":
    if check_death():
        set_ai_mode(1)
        mode_jmp()
    mode_jmp()

mode "shot":
    if range_check(0, 2, 6.0f):
        move_speed(0.0f)
        shootemup(8, 0, 0, 13)
        end_cycle()
    move_speed(3.0f)
    when move_to(3, 1, 5.0f) completes:
        end_cycle()
    end_cycle()

mode "die":
    when animation(0, 30, 0) completes:
        start_timer()
        set_ai_mode(2)
        end_cycle()
    end_cycle()

mode "gone":
    if check_timer(1, 8.0f):
        ai_killed(0)
        end_cycle()
    end_cycle()
